#
#   counter_style_system_style_value - CounterStyleSystemStyleValue: @counter-style's system
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/CounterStyleSystemStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-142) and the
#       inline members of CounterStyleSystemStyleValue.h: a system keyword, `fixed <integer>?` or
#       `extends <counter-style-name>`, and the symbol-count rules each system imposes.
